              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "atracar — \"to hold up, to mug; to moor\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Dos hombres atracaron un banco en el centro. Two men held up a bank in the centre."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Un atraco is a hold-up. For a boat, atracar means to moor."
            }
          ]
        },
